This license is an independent work and is not an official GNU or Free Software Foundation text. It is modeled on the goals and effects of the GPLv3 and AGPLv3, but uses its own wording.

**In short:** Anyone may use this license for their own projects and distribute unmodified copies of the license text. Anyone who modifies and distributes code licensed under the PSL must keep it under the PSL (that's the copyleft core). However, anyone who modifies the **license text itself** may not call the result "PaperStream License" (see Section 9).

